{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01PdKybAveMfxK3FTy1DETYp","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: 'Item dominance weakens under model-as-facet reanalysis (单模型~54%\n2\t  → 多模型35%) 但仍是最大单一 方差源；与 model×item 的差距仅 ~13pp，在 GSM8K 上 CI 重叠甚至反转。跨 benchmark 梯度方向性\n3\t  存在（MMLU 35% → GSM8K 20%）但非单调——HellaSwag ≈ MMLU 打破预期 knowledge→reasoning 排序。 可分离性在知识型任务上成立（<1%\n4\t  binary）但 text_match 下已显现裂痕（2.8%）；推理型 benchmark 因设计限制（仅 bf16/fp16）未被直接测试，需标注为 projected\n5\t  failure。D-study 预算跨 benchmark 有差异（480-780 items for G≥0.90）但不如预期戏剧性。Gemma 排除（3 模型）。Claim\n6\t  1 弱化为 「item 和 model×item 联合主导」；Claim 2 限定为「benchmark-conditional separability —\n7\t  知识 任务上成立，推理任务上预计失败」；Claim 3 加重 benchmark-specificity 措辞。AAAI 可行但紧； ACL ARR 是现实备选。\n8\t\n9\t  '\n10\timagined_experiments:\n11\t- name: Full-scale MMLU precision study\n12\t  plan_id: exp-001\n13\t  description: '4 models attempted, Gemma-2-9B-IT fp16 触发 vLLM 数值保护，仅完成 bf16+fp32。\n14\t    最终 3 模型 (Qwen3-8B, Llama-3.1-8B, Mistral-7B) 完成全部 3 prec × 6 prompts × 6 seeds\n15\t    × 3 temps × 4 orderings × 200 items = 1296 conditions/model。 V0 enforce_eager\n16\t    修复了 engine confound。\n17\t\n18\t    '\n19\t  expected_results:\n20\t    total_records_3model: 777600\n21\t    gemma_partial_records: 172800\n22\t    total_records: 950400\n23\t    conditions_per_model: 1296\n24\t    accuracy_llama_bf16: 0.711\n25\t    accuracy_llama_fp16: 0.711\n26\t    accuracy_llama_fp32: 0.604\n27\t    accuracy_qwen_bf16: 0.698\n28\t    accuracy_qwen_fp16: 0.695\n29\t    accuracy_qwen_fp32: 0.621\n30\t    accuracy_mistral_bf16: 0.637\n31\t    accuracy_mistral_fp16: 0.635\n32\t    accuracy_mistral_fp32: 0.584\n33\t    item_id_pct_llama: 57.8\n34\t    item_id_pct_qwen: 52.6\n35\t    item_id_pct_mistral: 48.2\n36\t    item_id_pct_avg: 52.9\n37\t    residual_pct_avg: 17.1\n38\t    precision_x_item_pct_avg: 7.0\n39\t    temperature_x_item_pct_avg: 6.4\n40\t    prompt_x_item_pct_avg: 5.6\n41\t    seed_x_item_pct_avg: 3.1\n42\t    ordering_x_item_pct_avg: 2.0\n43\t    precision_pct_avg: 2.1\n44\t    temperature_pct_avg: 1.5\n45\t    prompt_pct_avg: 0.9\n46\t    precision_x_temperature_binary_avg: 0.3\n47\t    g_coeff_binary_200item_avg: 0.33\n48\t    g_coeff_text_match_200item_avg: 0.94\n49\t    g_coeff_binary_range: '[0.30, 0.36]'\n50\t    fp32_bf16_gap_pp_avg: 8.2\n51\t    null_predictions_total: 125\n52\t    gpu_hours_used: 88\n53\t  result_rationale: 'item_id 均值 52.9% 比 MVP (58.4%) 略低，因为 MVP 是单模型 (Llama) 的 108 条件设计，\n54\t    扩展到 3 模型和 1296 条件后估计更稳定。模型间 item_id 从 48.2% (Mistral) 到 57.8% (Llama) 变异 ~10pp：Mistral\n55\t    整体准确率低 (0.635)，更多 items 接近猜测基线 (p≈0.25)， Bernoulli p(1-p) 变异小于高准确率模型，机械性压缩了 item_id。但在单模型分析中无法分离\n56\t    model×item——这部分方差归入 item_id 和 residual，预示 exp-004 model-as-facet 会大幅 重塑方差结构。precision×temperature\n57\t    交互 0.3% (binary) 与 MVP 一致：fp32 degradation 是精度主效应而非与 temperature 的交互效应。G=0.33\n58\t    (binary) 验证了 200 items 不足以 支撑可靠 model ranking 的核心叙事。text_match G=0.94 的巨大反差锚定了\n59\t    Claim 3。 Gemma fp16 失败是已知架构限制——median 档下没有修复路径，排除后 3 模型设计仍平衡。\n60\t\n61\t    '\n62\t  tables:\n63\t  - name: 'Table 1: Per-model accuracy (precision × temperature, 6-prompt 6-seed 4-ordering\n64\t      avg)'\n65\t    rows:\n66\t    - model: Llama\n67\t      bf16_T0.0: 0.73\n68\t      bf16_T0.3: 0.709\n69\t      bf16_T0.7: 0.694\n70\t      fp16_T0.0: 0.731\n71\t      fp16_T0.3: 0.708\n72\t      fp16_T0.7: 0.695\n73\t      fp32_T0.0: 0.622\n74\t      fp32_T0.3: 0.602\n75\t      fp32_T0.7: 0.588\n76\t    - model: Qwen\n77\t      bf16_T0.0: 0.718\n78\t      bf16_T0.3: 0.696\n79\t      bf16_T0.7: 0.681\n80\t      fp16_T0.0: 0.716\n81\t      fp16_T0.3: 0.693\n82\t      fp16_T0.7: 0.677\n83\t      fp32_T0.0: 0.641\n84\t      fp32_T0.3: 0.619\n85\t      fp32_T0.7: 0.604\n86\t    - model: Mistral\n87\t      bf16_T0.0: 0.658\n88\t      bf16_T0.3: 0.636\n89\t      bf16_T0.7: 0.618\n90\t      fp16_T0.0: 0.656\n91\t      fp16_T0.3: 0.633\n92\t      fp16_T0.7: 0.615\n93\t      fp32_T0.0: 0.603\n94\t      fp32_T0.3: 0.582\n95\t      fp32_T0.7: 0.567\n96\t  - name: 'Table 2: Single-model G-study variance decomposition (binary, %)'\n97\t    rows:\n98\t    - source: item_id\n99\t      Llama: 57.8\n100\t      Qwen: 52.6\n101\t      Mistral: 48.2\n102\t      avg: 52.9\n103\t    - source: residual\n104\t      Llama: 15.2\n105\t      Qwen: 17.4\n106\t      Mistral: 18.6\n107\t      avg: 17.1\n108\t    - source: prec×item\n109\t      Llama: 7.5\n110\t      Qwen: 7.2\n111\t      Mistral: 6.4\n112\t      avg: 7.0\n113\t    - source: temp×item\n114\t      Llama: 5.8\n115\t      Qwen: 6.5\n116\t      Mistral: 6.8\n117\t      avg: 6.4\n118\t    - source: prompt×item\n119\t      Llama: 4.8\n120\t      Qwen: 5.8\n121\t      Mistral: 6.2\n122\t      avg: 5.6\n123\t    - source: seed×item\n124\t      Llama: 2.8\n125\t      Qwen: 3.1\n126\t      Mistral: 3.4\n127\t      avg: 3.1\n128\t    - source: order×item\n129\t      Llama: 1.8\n130\t      Qwen: 2.0\n131\t      Mistral: 2.3\n132\t      avg: 2.0\n133\t    - source: precision\n134\t      Llama: 1.6\n135\t      Qwen: 2.0\n136\t      Mistral: 2.8\n137\t      avg: 2.1\n138\t    - source: temperature\n139\t      Llama: 1.2\n140\t      Qwen: 1.4\n141\t      Mistral: 1.8\n142\t      avg: 1.5\n143\t    - source: prec×temp\n144\t      Llama: 0.2\n145\t      Qwen: 0.3\n146\t      Mistral: 0.5\n147\t      avg: 0.3\n148\t    - source: other\n149\t      Llama: 1.3\n150\t      Qwen: 1.7\n151\t      Mistral: 3.0\n152\t      avg: 2.0\n153\t  figures_description:\n154\t  - Stacked-bar 方差分解对比 3 个模型 (binary)。item_id 始终最大但 Mistral 明显低于 Llama (48% vs 58%)，预示\n155\t    model-as-facet 的必要性。\n156\t  - Precision × temperature 交互热力图 (binary, per model)。fp32 在所有 temp 下系统偏低，交互项 <0.5%。\n157\t  analysis: 'exp-001 确认了 item dominance 的基本事实但暴露了模型依赖性。Mistral 的 item_id 低 (48%) 源于其\n158\t    MMLU 表现较弱导致的 Bernoulli 效应，这将在 exp-004 的 MD1 分析中被量化。 fp32 degradation 在 V0 enforce_eager\n159\t    下持续 (~8pp)，证实是真实精度效应。G=0.33 为 D-study narrative 提供了锚点。3 模型设计允许 model-as-facet\n160\t    但自由度有限。\n161\t\n162\t    '\n163\t- name: Item resampling stability test\n164\t  plan_id: exp-001b\n165\t  description: '3 independent stratified 200-item MMLU samples (seeds 0, 7, 99) ×\n166\t    Llama × 3 prec × 3 prompts × 3 seeds × 2 orderings = 54 conditions/sample × 200\n167\t    items。\n168\t\n169\t    '\n170\t  expected_results:\n171\t    total_records_per_sample: 10800\n172\t    total_records: 32400\n173\t    item_id_pct_sample0: 55.2\n174\t    item_id_pct_sample7: 50.8\n175\t    item_id_pct_sample99: 58.6\n176\t    item_id_mean: 54.9\n177\t    item_id_sd: 3.9\n178\t    item_id_cv: 0.071\n179\t    g_coeff_binary_sample0: 0.34\n180\t    g_coeff_binary_sample7: 0.3\n181\t    g_coeff_binary_sample99: 0.36\n182\t    g_coeff_mean: 0.333\n183\t    g_coeff_sd: 0.03\n184\t    accuracy_range: '[0.669, 0.691]'\n185\t    residual_pct_range: '[14.2, 18.6]'\n186\t    item_id_always_largest: true\n187\t    gpu_hours_used: 12\n188\t  result_rationale: 'item_id 从 50.8% 到 58.6% (SD=3.9pp) 反映了 stratified sampling 未完全消除的\n189\t    item 难度分布变异。sample7 (50.8%) 恰好抽到了更均匀的 item 难度分布——容易题和 难题的比例更平衡——导致 Bernoulli p(1-p)\n190\t    变异较小，item_id 机械性降低。这个 ~8pp 极差在 median 档下是 「noisy but directionally consistent」——item_id\n191\t    始终最大， 但精确百分比对 item draw 敏感。G-coefficient 的 0.30-0.36 范围传递了一致信号： 200 items (binary)\n192\t    总是不够。CV=7.1% 说明 headline number 必须报告为区间。\n193\t\n194\t    '\n195\t  tables:\n196\t  - name: 'Table 3: Resampling stability across 3 item draws'\n197\t    rows:\n198\t    - metric: item_id_pct\n199\t      s0: 55.2\n200\t      s7: 50.8\n201\t      s99: 58.6\n202\t      mean: 54.9\n203\t      sd: 3.9\n204\t    - metric: residual_pct\n205\t      s0: 15.8\n206\t      s7: 18.6\n207\t      s99: 14.2\n208\t      mean: 16.2\n209\t      sd: 2.3\n210\t    - metric: g_binary\n211\t      s0: 0.34\n212\t      s7: 0.3\n213\t      s99: 0.36\n214\t      mean: 0.333\n215\t      sd: 0.03\n216\t    - metric: g_text_match\n217\t      s0: 0.93\n218\t      s7: 0.91\n219\t      s99: 0.95\n220\t      mean: 0.93\n221\t      sd: 0.02\n222\t    - metric: accuracy\n223\t      s0: 0.678\n224\t      s7: 0.691\n225\t      s99: 0.669\n226\t      mean: 0.679\n227\t      sd: 0.011\n228\t  figures_description:\n229\t  - 3-sample item_id 分布图 with 95% CI。方向一致但 CI 宽。\n230\t  analysis: 'item 抽样引入 ~4pp SD 的不确定性，强化了 bootstrap CI (exp-004) 的方法论必要性。 关键收获：G-coefficient\n231\t    结论 (binary < 0.40) 跨样本稳健；headline item_id 需要 报告为 ~55% [51, 59] 而非点估计。\n232\t\n233\t    '\n234\t- name: Multi-benchmark replication\n235\t  plan_id: exp-002\n236\t  description: '3 models (Gemma excluded) × 2 prec (bf16/fp16) × 6 prompts × 6 seeds\n237\t    × 2 temps (T=0.0, T=0.7) × 4 orderings × 200 items, on GSM8K, ARC-Challenge, HellaSwag.\n238\t    Reduced design (2 prec × 2 temp vs exp-001 的 3×3)。\n239\t\n240\t    '\n241\t  expected_results:\n242\t    conditions_per_model_per_bench: 576\n243\t    total_records_per_bench: 345600\n244\t    total_records: 1036800\n245\t    accuracy_gsm8k: 0.412\n246\t    accuracy_arc: 0.588\n247\t    accuracy_hellaswag: 0.762\n248\t    item_id_pct_gsm8k: 34.5\n249\t    item_id_pct_arc: 43.8\n250\t    item_id_pct_hellaswag: 51.2\n251\t    seed_x_item_gsm8k: 11.5\n252\t    temp_x_item_gsm8k: 10.8\n253\t    prompt_x_item_gsm8k: 9.2\n254\t    seed_x_item_arc: 5.8\n255\t    temp_x_item_arc: 7.2\n256\t    prompt_x_item_arc: 7.5\n257\t    seed_x_item_hellaswag: 3.4\n258\t    temp_x_item_hellaswag: 5.5\n259\t    prompt_x_item_hellaswag: 5.2\n260\t    precision_x_temp_gsm8k_binary: 0.2\n261\t    precision_x_temp_arc_binary: 0.15\n262\t    precision_x_temp_hellaswag_binary: 0.1\n263\t    precision_x_item_gsm8k: 1.2\n264\t    precision_x_item_arc: 1.8\n265\t    precision_x_item_hellaswag: 2.5\n266\t    residual_gsm8k: 23.8\n267\t    residual_arc: 18.5\n268\t    residual_hellaswag: 15.8\n269\t    g_coeff_binary_gsm8k: 0.22\n270\t    g_coeff_binary_arc: 0.28\n271\t    g_coeff_binary_hellaswag: 0.35\n272\t    g_coeff_text_match_gsm8k: 0.78\n273\t    g_coeff_text_match_arc: 0.88\n274\t    g_coeff_text_match_hellaswag: 0.95\n275\t    gpu_hours_used: 178\n276\t  result_rationale: 'GSM8K item_id (34.5%, 单模型) 大幅低于 MMLU (52.9%)，因为数学推理中 seed 和 temperature\n277\t    通过改变 chain-of-thought 路径产生强 item-conditional 效应。同一数学题 在不同 seed 下走不同推理链——有的走通有的走不通——seed×item\n278\t    (11.5%) 和 temp×item (10.8%) 合计 >22%，远超 MMLU 的 ~9.5%。ARC (43.8%) 居中因为科学推理也有 prompt/\n279\t    seed sensitivity 但弱于数学。HellaSwag (51.2%) 接近 MMLU (52.9%) 是 median 档的 关键特征——commonsense\n280\t    补全任务的方差结构更接近 knowledge retrieval 而非 multi-step reasoning，因为 HellaSwag 主要考验的是 pattern\n281\t    completion 而非推理链。这打破了预期 的单调 knowledge→reasoning 梯度。precision 交互在 bf16/fp16-only\n282\t    设计下全部 <0.3% (binary)——这不构成对 separability 的有力测试，因为 bf16≈fp16 是已知的。真正的 separability\n283\t    测试需要 fp32 或 hardware crossing，只在 exp-001/003 (MMLU) 中完成。 G-coefficient 梯度 (0.22→0.35\n284\t    binary) 说明 200-item binary 可靠性系统性随任务类型 变化，但 text_match 下 HellaSwag 已达 0.95，强化\n285\t    metric-conditional 叙事。\n286\t\n287\t    '\n288\t  tables:\n289\t  - name: 'Table 4: Cross-benchmark single-model variance decomposition (binary, 3-model\n290\t      avg, %)'\n291\t    rows:\n292\t    - source: item_id\n293\t      GSM8K: 34.5\n294\t      ARC: 43.8\n295\t      HellaSwag: 51.2\n296\t      MMLU (exp-001): 52.9\n297\t    - source: residual\n298\t      GSM8K: 23.8\n299\t      ARC: 18.5\n300\t      HellaSwag: 15.8\n301\t      MMLU (exp-001): 17.1\n302\t    - source: seed×item\n303\t      GSM8K: 11.5\n304\t      ARC: 5.8\n305\t      HellaSwag: 3.4\n306\t      MMLU (exp-001): 3.1\n307\t    - source: temp×item\n308\t      GSM8K: 10.8\n309\t      ARC: 7.2\n310\t      HellaSwag: 5.5\n311\t      MMLU (exp-001): 6.4\n312\t    - source: prompt×item\n313\t      GSM8K: 9.2\n314\t      ARC: 7.5\n315\t      HellaSwag: 5.2\n316\t      MMLU (exp-001): 5.6\n317\t    - source: prec×item\n318\t      GSM8K: 1.2\n319\t      ARC: 1.8\n320\t      HellaSwag: 2.5\n321\t      MMLU (exp-001): 7.0\n322\t    - source: prec×temp\n323\t      GSM8K: 0.2\n324\t      ARC: 0.15\n325\t      HellaSwag: 0.1\n326\t      MMLU (exp-001): 0.3\n327\t    - source: other\n328\t      GSM8K: 8.8\n329\t      ARC: 15.25\n330\t      HellaSwag: 16.3\n331\t      MMLU (exp-001): 7.6\n332\t  - name: 'Table 5: Per-benchmark accuracy by model (bf16, all-condition avg)'\n333\t    rows:\n334\t    - benchmark: GSM8K\n335\t      Llama: 0.486\n336\t      Qwen: 0.452\n337\t      Mistral: 0.298\n338\t    - benchmark: ARC\n339\t      Llama: 0.641\n340\t      Qwen: 0.618\n341\t      Mistral: 0.505\n342\t    - benchmark: HellaSwag\n343\t      Llama: 0.798\n344\t      Qwen: 0.782\n345\t      Mistral: 0.707\n346\t  - name: 'Table 6: G-coefficients by benchmark × metric (200 items)'\n347\t    rows:\n348\t    - benchmark: GSM8K\n349\t      g_binary: 0.22\n350\t      g_text_match: 0.78\n351\t    - benchmark: ARC\n352\t      g_binary: 0.28\n353\t      g_text_match: 0.88\n354\t    - benchmark: HellaSwag\n355\t      g_binary: 0.35\n356\t      g_text_match: 0.95\n357\t    - benchmark: MMLU (exp-001)\n358\t      g_binary: 0.33\n359\t      g_text_match: 0.94\n360\t  figures_description:\n361\t  - Stacked-bar 方差分解 across 4 benchmarks (MMLU from exp-001 + 3 new)。论文 signature\n362\t    figure 草稿——item_id 递减但 HellaSwag ≈ MMLU。注意 MMLU 的 prec×item 偏高因为 3 prec vs 其余\n363\t    2 prec，设计不对称标注在图注中。\n364\t  - G-coefficient by benchmark × metric (binary vs text_match)。分组柱状图显示 binary 和 text_match\n365\t    的鲜明反差。\n366\t  analysis: 'cross-benchmark gradient 的方向性成立但非单调：HellaSwag (51.2%) 与 MMLU (52.9%)\n367\t    仅差 1.7pp (统计上不可区分)，ARC (43.8%) 居中，GSM8K (34.5%) 明显更低。梯度范围 18.4pp (52.9→34.5)。但这是单模型数据——model-as-facet\n368\t    (exp-004) 会进一步压缩 item_id 并可能 改变排序。exp-002 的 bf16/fp16-only 设计意味着 precision 相关方差分量不可与\n369\t    exp-001 (3 prec) 直接比较；MD8 sensitivity analysis 需要 re-analyze MMLU with matched\n370\t    2×2。\n371\t\n372\t    '\n373\t- name: Multi-hardware G-study\n374\t  plan_id: exp-003\n375\t  description: '3 models × 2 GPU types (RTX PRO 6000 + second GPU) × 2 prec (bf16/fp16)\n376\t    × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 3 temps × 4 orderings × 200 MMLU items。 Second GPU 可用性有限——仅\n377\t    2 models 在 second GPU 上完成全部设计。\n378\t\n379\t    '\n380\t  expected_results:\n381\t    total_records_primary_gpu: 518400\n382\t    total_records_second_gpu: 230400\n383\t    total_records: 748800\n384\t    models_on_both_gpus: 2\n385\t    second_gpu_availability_days: 8\n386\t    hardware_main_effect_pp: 0.14\n387\t    hardware_pct_variance: 0.08\n388\t    hardware_x_item_pct: 1.8\n389\t    hardware_x_precision_pct: 0.12\n390\t    hardware_x_temperature_pct: 0.06\n391\t    hardware_x_prompt_pct: 0.03\n392\t    hardware_x_seed_pct: 0.02\n393\t    direct_infra_x_method_binary: 0.5\n394\t    direct_infra_x_method_text_match: 2.8\n395\t    item_id_pct_with_hw: 53.2\n396\t    precision_pct: 0.15\n397\t    hardware_pct: 0.08\n398\t    residual_pct: 15.8\n399\t    max_item_accuracy_gap_across_gpus_pp: 3.2\n400\t    items_with_flipped_majority_vote: 4\n401\t    gpu_hours_used: 95\n402\t  result_rationale: 'hardware 主效应极小 (0.14pp) 因为相同 vLLM 代码路径在不同 GPU 上产生几乎相同的结果； 差异来自\n403\t    CUDA kernel 层面的浮点非确定性和 GPU 架构特定的 tensor core 实现差异。 hardware×item (1.8%) 比 hardware\n404\t    主效应大一个数量级，因为 logit margin 极小的 items (模型在 0/1 边界附近的题) 对硬件级数值噪声敏感。但 1.8% 仍远小于 precision×item\n405\t    (MMLU exp-001 ~7%)，说明 GPU 型号的影响远弱于精度选择。direct infra×method 在 binary 下 0.5% (边缘通过\n406\t    <1% 阈值)，text_match 下 2.8%——后者由 precision×temperature (1.5%) + hardware×temperature\n407\t    (0.8%) + hardware×precision (0.5%) 累积而成。median 档的 关键限制是 second GPU 仅支持 2 模型，估计精度有限，结论需标注为\n408\t    preliminary。\n409\t\n410\t    '\n411\t  tables:\n412\t  - name: 'Table 7: Hardware effect summary (2-model balanced MMLU)'\n413\t    rows:\n414\t    - metric: aggregate accuracy gap (pp)\n415\t      value: 0.14\n416\t    - metric: max item-level gap (pp)\n417\t      value: 3.2\n418\t    - metric: hardware % total variance\n419\t      value: 0.08\n420\t    - metric: hardware×item % variance\n421\t      value: 1.8\n422\t    - metric: direct infra×method binary (%)\n423\t      value: 0.5\n424\t    - metric: direct infra×method text_match (%)\n425\t      value: 2.8\n426\t    - metric: items with flipped majority vote\n427\t      value: 4\n428\t  figures_description:\n429\t  - GPU A vs GPU B item-level accuracy scatter (200 items × 2 models)。绝大多数 items 在对角线上；4\n430\t    个偏离点标注——均为 low-margin items。\n431\t  analysis: 'multi-hardware 支持 aggregate separability but with caveats。binary 0.5%\n432\t    勉强通过 <1% 阈值；text_match 2.8% 明确超过实际意义阈值。论文应将此定位为 「preliminary evidence supporting\n433\t    separability on MMLU under binary scoring, with metric-conditional violation under\n434\t    text_match」。2-model 限制意味着 bootstrap CI 很宽——hardware facet 的估计是所有方差分量中精度最低的。\n435\t\n436\t    '\n437\t- name: Comprehensive analysis\n438\t  plan_id: exp-004\n439\t  description: 'Combined analysis of exp-001/001b/002/003。核心产出：model-as-facet reanalysis,\n440\t    bootstrap CIs, D-study projections, G-theory vs IRT, all MD defense analyses。\n441\t    纯分析实验 (0 GPU hours)。\n442\t\n443\t    '\n444\t  expected_results:\n445\t    maf_item_id_mmlu: 35.0\n446\t    maf_model_x_item_mmlu: 21.5\n447\t    maf_model_mmlu: 8.2\n448\t    maf_residual_mmlu: 12.8\n449\t    maf_prec_x_item_mmlu: 5.2\n450\t    maf_temp_x_item_mmlu: 4.6\n451\t    maf_prompt_x_item_mmlu: 4.0\n452\t    maf_seed_x_item_mmlu: 2.5\n453\t    maf_order_x_item_mmlu: 1.5\n454\t    maf_model_x_prec_mmlu: 0.5\n455\t    maf_model_x_temp_mmlu: 0.3\n456\t    maf_other_mmlu: 3.9\n457\t    maf_item_id_hellaswag: 33.0\n458\t    maf_item_id_arc: 27.0\n459\t    maf_item_id_gsm8k: 20.0\n460\t    maf_model_x_item_hellaswag: 16.0\n461\t    maf_model_x_item_arc: 18.5\n462\t    maf_model_x_item_gsm8k: 26.0\n463\t    maf_model_gsm8k: 14.0\n464\t    maf_model_arc: 12.0\n465\t    maf_model_hellaswag: 9.5\n466\t    ci_item_id_mmlu: '[28.5, 41.5]'\n467\t    ci_model_x_item_mmlu: '[15.0, 28.0]'\n468\t    ci_item_id_gsm8k: '[13.5, 26.5]'\n469\t    ci_model_x_item_gsm8k: '[19.5, 32.5]'\n470\t    ci_width_item_id_mmlu: 13.0\n471\t    ci_width_item_id_gsm8k: 13.0\n472\t    ci_overlap_mmlu: false\n473\t    ci_overlap_hellaswag: false\n474\t    ci_overlap_arc: false\n475\t    ci_overlap_gsm8k: true\n476\t    dstudy_g90_mmlu: 620\n477\t    dstudy_g90_hellaswag: 480\n478\t    dstudy_g90_arc: 540\n479\t    dstudy_g90_gsm8k: 780\n480\t    dstudy_g95_mmlu: 1100\n481\t    dstudy_g_at_200_mmlu_binary: 0.3\n482\t    dstudy_g_at_200_mmlu_text_match: 0.93\n483\t    dstudy_g_at_14k_mmlu_binary: 0.985\n484\t    reml_henderson_max_diff_pp: 2.8\n485\t    reml_henderson_rank_preserved: true\n486\t    logprob_item_id_mmlu: 48.0\n487\t    logprob_item_id_gsm8k: 25.0\n488\t    gtheory_items_mmlu: 620\n489\t    irt_tinyBench_items: 100\n490\t    gtheory_irt_ratio: 6.2\n491\t    power_detect_2pct: 0.88\n492\t    power_detect_1pct: 0.62\n493\t    fixed_random_max_diff_pp: 3.5\n494\t    fixed_random_rank_preserved: true\n495\t    bernoulli_corr_with_item_id: 0.72\n496\t    bootstrap_jackknife_ci_ratio: 1.15\n497\t    mmlu_3x3_vs_2x2_item_id_diff: 2.1\n498\t    g_at_14k_binary: 0.985\n499\t    gpu_hours_for_g90_mmlu: 45\n500\t    gpu_hours_for_g90_gsm8k: 85\n501\t  result_rationale: 'model-as-facet 将 MMLU item_id 从 52.9% 压到 35%：差额中 ~17.9pp 被重新归因为\n502\t    model×item (21.5%) 和 model (8.2%)。在单模型分析中，不同模型对不同 items 的差异化 表现 (differential\n503\t    item functioning) 被隐藏在 item_id 和 residual 中；3 模型设计 使其可分离。35% 仍是最大方差源，但与 model×item\n504\t    (21.5%) 的差距仅 13.5pp。在 GSM8K 上 model×item (26%) 反超 item_id (20%)——因为 3 模型在数学题上的能力差异极大\n505\t    (Qwen 45% vs Mistral 30%)，且不同模型擅长不同类型的数学题，创造了巨大的 model×item 交互。GSM8K 的 CI 重叠 ([13.5,\n506\t    26.5] vs [19.5, 32.5]) 是 median 档的标志—— 无法在统计上区分 item_id 和 model×item 谁更大。 D-study\n507\t    620 items (MMLU binary G≥0.90) vs IRT 100 items 的 6.2× 差距反映了本质区别： IRT 只关注 item\n508\t    sampling 对排名一致性的影响，G-theory 同时控制 prompt/seed/ordering 的变异性。620 items 是对「用 1 prompt\n509\t    + 1 seed + 200 items 评估」这种 common practice 的方法论批判——但 480-780 的跨 benchmark 范围说明\n510\t    differentiation 没有预期的戏剧性。 Bernoulli 相关 r=0.72 说明 item_id 中约一半是 p(1-p) 机械效应，但这不削弱\n511\t    practical implication——item 选择确实改变评估结果。bootstrap vs jackknife CI 比值 1.15 说明 bootstrap\n512\t    略微高估不确定性（因为重采样破坏 item 独立性），但差异可接受。\n513\t\n514\t    '\n515\t  tables:\n516\t  - name: 'Table 8: Model-as-facet variance decomposition across benchmarks (binary,\n517\t      %)'\n518\t    rows:\n519\t    - source: item_id\n520\t      MMLU: 35.0\n521\t      HellaSwag: 33.0\n522\t      ARC: 27.0\n523\t      GSM8K: 20.0\n524\t    - source: model×item\n525\t      MMLU: 21.5\n526\t      HellaSwag: 16.0\n527\t      ARC: 18.5\n528\t      GSM8K: 26.0\n529\t    - source: model\n530\t      MMLU: 8.2\n531\t      HellaSwag: 9.5\n532\t      ARC: 12.0\n533\t      GSM8K: 14.0\n534\t    - source: residual\n535\t      MMLU: 12.8\n536\t      HellaSwag: 14.0\n537\t      ARC: 16.0\n538\t      GSM8K: 13.5\n539\t    - source: temp×item\n540\t      MMLU: 4.6\n541\t      HellaSwag: 5.2\n542\t      ARC: 6.0\n543\t      GSM8K: 7.8\n544\t    - source: prompt×item\n545\t      MMLU: 4.0\n546\t      HellaSwag: 4.5\n547\t      ARC: 5.8\n548\t      GSM8K: 6.5\n549\t    - source: prec×item\n550\t      MMLU: 5.2\n551\t      HellaSwag: 3.5\n552\t      ARC: 1.5\n553\t      GSM8K: 1.0\n554\t    - source: seed×item\n555\t      MMLU: 2.5\n556\t      HellaSwag: 2.8\n557\t      ARC: 4.0\n558\t      GSM8K: 5.5\n559\t    - source: other\n560\t      MMLU: 6.2\n561\t      HellaSwag: 11.5\n562\t      ARC: 9.2\n563\t      GSM8K: 5.7\n564\t  - name: 'Table 9: Bootstrap 95% CIs on item_id and model×item (pp)'\n565\t    rows:\n566\t    - benchmark: MMLU\n567\t      item_id: 35.0 [28.5–41.5]\n568\t      model_x_item: 21.5 [15.0–28.0]\n569\t      overlap: 'No'\n570\t    - benchmark: HellaSwag\n571\t      item_id: 33.0 [26.0–40.0]\n572\t      model_x_item: 16.0 [10.5–21.5]\n573\t      overlap: 'No'\n574\t    - benchmark: ARC\n575\t      item_id: 27.0 [20.5–33.5]\n576\t      model_x_item: 18.5 [12.0–25.0]\n577\t      overlap: 'No'\n578\t    - benchmark: GSM8K\n579\t      item_id: 20.0 [13.5–26.5]\n580\t      model_x_item: 26.0 [19.5–32.5]\n581\t      overlap: 'Yes'\n582\t  - name: 'Table 10: D-study — items for target G (binary, 6 prompts × 6 seeds averaged)'\n583\t    rows:\n584\t    - benchmark: MMLU\n585\t      G_0.80: 280\n586\t      G_0.90: 620\n587\t      G_0.95: 1100\n588\t      G_0.99: 4200\n589\t    - benchmark: HellaSwag\n590\t      G_0.80: 240\n591\t      G_0.90: 480\n592\t      G_0.95: 850\n593\t      G_0.99: 3200\n594\t    - benchmark: ARC\n595\t      G_0.80: 260\n596\t      G_0.90: 540\n597\t      G_0.95: 960\n598\t      G_0.99: 3600\n599\t    - benchmark: GSM8K\n600\t      G_0.80: 380\n601\t      G_0.90: 780\n602\t      G_0.95: 1400\n603\t      G_0.99: 5200\n604\t  - name: 'Table 11: G-theory vs IRT subsampling (MMLU)'\n605\t    rows:\n606\t    - framework: G-theory D-study\n607\t      items: 620\n608\t      facets: item+prompt+seed+temp+order+prec\n609\t      target: G≥0.90\n610\t    - framework: tinyBenchmarks IRT\n611\t      items: 100\n612\t      facets: item only\n613\t      target: r≥0.95 with full\n614\t    - framework: ratio\n615\t      items: 6.2×\n616\t      facets: —\n617\t      target: different definitions\n618\t  - name: 'Table 12: Methodological defense results summary'\n619\t    rows:\n620\t    - defense: MD1 Bernoulli\n621\t      result: r=0.72 with p(1-p); ~50% mechanical\n622\t      verdict: acknowledged, text_match parallel validates\n623\t    - defense: MD2 Fixed vs random\n624\t      result: max diff 3.5pp, rank preserved\n625\t      verdict: robust\n626\t    - defense: MD5 Full benchmark G\n627\t      result: G=0.985 at 14K items (binary)\n628\t      verdict: 200-item G correctly interpreted as subsample cost\n629\t    - defense: MD6 Bootstrap vs jackknife\n630\t      result: CI ratio 1.15\n631\t      verdict: bootstrap slightly wider, acceptable\n632\t    - defense: MD8 Design asymmetry\n633\t      result: 3×3 vs 2×2 diff 2.1pp item_id\n634\t      verdict: robust to design reduction\n635\t    - defense: MD9 Logprob scoring\n636\t      result: item_id 48% (MMLU) / 25% (GSM8K)\n637\t      verdict: gradient preserved across metrics\n638\t  figures_description:\n639\t  - 'Fig 3 (论文 signature figure): Model-as-facet stacked-bar across 4 benchmarks (binary)。item_id\n640\t    蓝色递减 35→20%, model×item 橙色在 GSM8K 反超。'\n641\t  - 'Fig 4: D-study projection curves — G vs item count for 4 benchmarks, binary。GSM8K\n642\t    曲线最右 (最多 items needed)。IRT tinyBenchmarks 100-item 参考线。'\n643\t  - 'Fig 5: Bootstrap CI forest plot, item_id vs model×item, 4 benchmarks。GSM8K CI\n644\t    重叠可视化。'\n645\t  - 'Fig 6: Bernoulli p(1-p) vs observed item variance scatter (MMLU), r=0.72。'\n646\t  analysis: 'exp-004 重新定义了叙事。Claim 1 从「item is THE dominant source」变为「item and model×item\n647\t    jointly dominate — their relative importance is benchmark-conditional」。 GSM8K\n648\t    上的 CI 重叠和 model×item 反超是 median 档最大的叙事压力点——需要诚实报告但 框定为「finding: even the variance\n649\t    structure itself varies across task types」。 D-study 的 benchmark-specificity (480-780\n650\t    items) 支持 Claim 3 但 differentiation 不戏剧性——4 benchmarks 都在 ~500-800 range，不是 100\n651\t    vs 2000 那样的鲜明对比。 G-theory vs IRT 的 6.2× gap 是可以独立展开的贡献——「the cost of multi-facet\n652\t    reliability」。power=0.88 for 2% interaction 意味着如果真实 infra×method 在 2% 以上我们大概率能检测到，但\n653\t    <1% 的效应 (power=0.62) 可能被遗漏——论文需承认这一限制。\n654\t\n655\t    '\n656\t- name: 14B model extension\n657\t  plan_id: exp-005\n658\t  description: 'Qwen3-14B, DeepSeek-R1-Distill-14B × bf16/fp16 × 6 prompts × 6 seeds\n659\t    × 2 temps × 4 orderings × 200 MMLU items。验证 scale robustness。\n660\t\n661\t    '\n662\t  expected_results:\n663\t    total_records_per_model: 115200\n664\t    total_records: 230400\n665\t    accuracy_qwen14b_bf16: 0.752\n666\t    accuracy_deepseek14b_bf16: 0.738\n667\t    precision_gap_pp_avg: 0.35\n668\t    item_id_pct_qwen14b: 50.5\n669\t    item_id_pct_deepseek14b: 46.8\n670\t    item_id_pct_avg: 48.7\n671\t    prompt_x_item_deepseek14b: 8.2\n672\t    g_coeff_binary_200_avg: 0.35\n673\t    gpu_hours_used: 85\n674\t  result_rationale: '14B 模型的 item_id (~49%) 略低于 8B (~53%)，因为更强的模型对更多 items 有高置信 正确答案\n675\t    (ceiling effect)，压缩了 item 间 accuracy 变异。precision gap 从 ~8pp 降到 <0.4pp——14B 模型\n676\t    logit margin 更大，bf16/fp16 truncation 几乎不翻转预测。 DeepSeek-R1-Distill 的 prompt×item\n677\t    偏高 (8.2%) 可能源于 reasoning-distilled 架构对 prompt 格式的条件依赖更强。整体方差结构保持一致，支持跨 scale 泛化。\n678\t\n679\t    '\n680\t  tables:\n681\t  - name: 'Table S1: 8B vs 14B variance structure (MMLU, single-model, binary, %)'\n682\t    rows:\n683\t    - source: item_id\n684\t      8B avg: 52.9\n685\t      Qwen3_14B: 50.5\n686\t      DeepSeek_14B: 46.8\n687\t    - source: prec×item\n688\t      8B avg: 7.0\n689\t      Qwen3_14B: 3.2\n690\t      DeepSeek_14B: 2.8\n691\t    - source: prompt×item\n692\t      8B avg: 5.6\n693\t      Qwen3_14B: 5.0\n694\t      DeepSeek_14B: 8.2\n695\t    - source: precision\n696\t      8B avg: 2.1\n697\t      Qwen3_14B: 0.2\n698\t      DeepSeek_14B: 0.15\n699\t  figures_description:\n700\t  - 'Fig S1: 8B vs 14B item_id comparison bar chart。Scale 增大 item_id 略降但 rank structure\n701\t    不变。'\n702\t  analysis: 'Scale robustness 得到确认。14B 的 precision sensitivity 大幅下降 (<0.4pp) 是一个 useful\n703\t    practical finding——更大的模型对数值精度更稳健。适合 Appendix/Supplementary。\n704\t\n705\t    '\n706\t- name: Fine-tuning G-study\n707\t  plan_id: exp-006\n708\t  description: 'RoBERTa-large fine-tuning × SST-2/MNLI/RTE/COPA。6 seeds × 3 LR × 4\n709\t    data shuffles × 3 GPUs × 2 precisions = 432 runs/task × 4 tasks = 1728 total。\n710\t\n711\t    '\n712\t  expected_results:\n713\t    total_runs: 1728\n714\t    tasks_completed: 4\n715\t    learning_rate_pct: 22.0\n716\t    seed_pct: 18.5\n717\t    data_shuffle_pct: 16.0\n718\t    item_id_pct: 12.5\n719\t    residual_pct: 14.0\n720\t    lr_x_item_pct: 4.8\n721\t    seed_x_item_pct: 5.5\n722\t    data_shuffle_x_item_pct: 3.5\n723\t    gpu_pct: 0.6\n724\t    precision_pct: 0.4\n725\t    gpu_x_precision_pct: 0.2\n726\t    other_pct: 2.0\n727\t    g_coeff_binary_avg: 0.45\n728\t    accuracy_sst2: 0.942\n729\t    accuracy_mnli: 0.876\n730\t    accuracy_rte: 0.728\n731\t    accuracy_copa: 0.685\n732\t    item_id_rank: 4\n733\t    top_source: learning_rate\n734\t    gpu_hours_used: 165\n735\t  result_rationale: 'fine-tuning 的方差层级与 inference 根本不同。learning_rate (22%) 主导因为 encoder\n736\t    fine-tuning 在小 LR 范围内对最终性能极敏感 (Dodge et al. 2020)。seed (18.5%) 和 data_shuffle\n737\t    (16%) 上升是因为 SGD 随机性在小数据集 (RTE 2.5K, COPA 400 samples) 上导致训练轨迹显著分歧——不同 seed 可能收敛到\n738\t    loss landscape 的不同局部最优。 item_id 降到 12.5% 因为 fine-tuning 让模型适应了 task-specific item\n739\t    难度分布， 压缩了 item 间差异。GPU 和 precision 合计 <1%——training 的随机性远超硬件噪声。 这个「方差层级翻转」(item_id\n740\t    从 #1 降到 #4) 表明 inference 和 fine-tuning 需要 完全不同的 reproducibility budget。\n741\t\n742\t    '\n743\t  tables:\n744\t  - name: 'Table S2: Inference vs fine-tuning variance hierarchy (%)'\n745\t    rows:\n746\t    - source: item_id / item_id\n747\t      inference_MMLU: 52.9\n748\t      finetuning_avg: 12.5\n749\t      shift: ↓41pp (#1→#4)\n750\t    - source: precision / learning_rate\n751\t      inference_MMLU: 2.1\n752\t      finetuning_avg: 22.0\n753\t      shift: ↑20pp (不同 facet)\n754\t    - source: seed main / seed main\n755\t      inference_MMLU: 0.2\n756\t      finetuning_avg: 18.5\n757\t      shift: ↑18pp\n758\t    - source: prompt / data_shuffle\n759\t      inference_MMLU: 0.9\n760\t      finetuning_avg: 16.0\n761\t      shift: ↑15pp (不同 facet)\n762\t    - source: GPU / GPU\n763\t      inference_MMLU: <0.1\n764\t      finetuning_avg: 0.6\n765\t      shift: ≈\n766\t  figures_description:\n767\t  - 'Fig S2: Paired stacked-bar: inference (MMLU) vs fine-tuning 方差层级。可视化 item_id\n768\t    和 LR/seed 的位置互换。'\n769\t  - 'Fig S3: Per-task fine-tuning 方差分解。RTE/COPA (小数据) 的 seed variance 远大于 SST-2/MNLI。'\n770\t  analysis: 'fine-tuning 结果为论文贡献了 scope qualification：item dominance 是 inference evaluation\n771\t    的特征，不是 ML evaluation 的普遍规律。GPU×precision 在 fine-tuning 中也可忽略 (0.2%)，说明 infra separability\n772\t    跨 paradigm 成立。RTE/COPA 的高 seed variance 与 Dodge et al. (2020) 一致。此实验适合论文 Discussion\n773\t    section 用于 界定 claims 的适用范围。\n774\t\n775\t    '\n776\t- name: LayerCast precision study\n777\t  plan_id: exp-007\n778\t  description: 'LayerCast (fp16 storage + fp32 compute) as 4th precision condition\n779\t    on MMLU。 Llama × 4 prec × 3 prompts × 3 seeds × 2 temps × 2 orderings × 200 items。\n780\t\n781\t    '\n782\t  expected_results:\n783\t    total_records: 28800\n784\t    conditions: 144\n785\t    accuracy_layercast: 0.708\n786\t    accuracy_bf16: 0.711\n787\t    accuracy_fp16: 0.711\n788\t    accuracy_fp32: 0.604\n789\t    layercast_bf16_gap_pp: 0.3\n790\t    layercast_fp32_gap_pp: 10.4\n791\t    precision_variance_with_layercast: 1.4\n792\t    precision_x_item_with_layercast: 4.8\n793\t    precision_variance_without_layercast: 2.1\n794\t    precision_x_item_without_layercast: 7.0\n795\t    gpu_hours_used: 18\n796\t  result_rationale: 'LayerCast (0.708) 接近 bf16 (0.711) 因为 fp32 compute path 保留了 attention\n797\t    计算精度，fp16 storage 不影响前向传播。与 pure fp32 (0.604) 的 10.4pp 差距证实 fp32 degradation 不是数值精度本身的问题，而是\n798\t    vLLM fp32 code path 的系统差异 (可能涉及不同的 attention kernel 或 memory layout)。从 G-theory\n799\t    角度，加入 LayerCast 后 precision 方差分量从 2.1% 降到 1.4%——有改善但不戏剧性，因为 fp32 仍然是 outlier。precision×item\n800\t    从 7.0% 降到 4.8% 说明 LayerCast 减少了 item-conditional 精度效应。这提供了 practical mitigation\n801\t    recommendation 但 不改变论文核心叙事。\n802\t\n803\t    '\n804\t  tables:\n805\t  - name: 'Table S3: LayerCast vs standard precisions (Llama, MMLU)'\n806\t    rows:\n807\t    - precision: LayerCast\n808\t      accuracy: 0.708\n809\t      prec_pct: 0.3\n810\t      prec_x_item_pct: 4.5\n811\t    - precision: bf16\n812\t      accuracy: 0.711\n813\t      prec_pct: 0.1\n814\t      prec_x_item_pct: 3.8\n815\t    - precision: fp16\n816\t      accuracy: 0.711\n817\t      prec_pct: 0.1\n818\t      prec_x_item_pct: 3.9\n819\t    - precision: fp32\n820\t      accuracy: 0.604\n821\t      prec_pct: 2.1\n822\t      prec_x_item_pct: 7.0\n823\t  figures_description:\n824\t  - 'Fig S4: 4-precision accuracy bar chart with LayerCast。LayerCast ≈ bf16 >> fp32。'\n825\t  analysis: 'LayerCast 是 Appendix mitigation recommendation。核心贡献是排除 fp32 degradation\n826\t    的「纯数值精度」解释——fp32 compute 在 LayerCast 中正常工作，问题出在 vLLM fp32 engine path。\n827\t\n828\t    '\n829\t- name: MATH benchmark extension\n830\t  plan_id: exp-008\n831\t  description: 'MATH (200 items) × 3 models × 2 prec (bf16/fp16) × 6 prompts × 6 seeds\n832\t    × 2 temps × 4 orderings。测试 chain-of-thought 推理的方差结构。\n833\t\n834\t    '\n835\t  expected_results:\n836\t    total_records: 345600\n837\t    accuracy_avg: 0.285\n838\t    accuracy_llama: 0.312\n839\t    accuracy_qwen: 0.335\n840\t    accuracy_mistral: 0.208\n841\t    item_id_pct: 28.0\n842\t    residual_pct: 26.5\n843\t    seed_x_item_pct: 12.8\n844\t    temp_x_item_pct: 11.5\n845\t    prompt_x_item_pct: 8.2\n846\t    precision_x_item_pct: 1.5\n847\t    seed_pct: 3.2\n848\t    temperature_pct: 3.5\n849\t    precision_x_temp_binary: 0.18\n850\t    other_pct: 4.62\n851\t    maf_item_id: 16.0\n852\t    maf_model_x_item: 28.0\n853\t    maf_model: 15.0\n854\t    g_coeff_binary_200: 0.18\n855\t    g_coeff_text_match_200: 0.62\n856\t    dstudy_g90_binary: 950\n857\t    gpu_hours_used: 42\n858\t  result_rationale: 'MATH 的 item_id (28% 单模型, 16% model-as-facet) 是所有 benchmarks 中最低的，\n859\t    因为多步数学推理中的 CoT 路径选择引入了巨大的 seed-conditional 和 temp-conditional item 变异。seed×item\n860\t    (12.8%) + temp×item (11.5%) 合计 24.3%——一道题能否做对 取决于模型恰好走了哪条推理链，这是高度随机的。residual\n861\t    高达 26.5% 反映了 CoT 的内在不可预测性——大量 item-level 方差无法归因于任何已测量 facet。model-as-facet 下 model×item\n862\t    (28%) > item_id (16%)：3 模型的数学能力差异极大 (Qwen 34% vs Mistral 21%)，且不同模型擅长不同类型的数学题\n863\t    (代数 vs 几何 vs 组合)，创造了 强 differential item functioning。precision×temperature 仅 0.18%\n864\t    (binary) 因为 bf16/fp16-only 设计——这不构成 separability 的有力测试。G=0.18 是所有 benchmark 中最低的，说明\n865\t    200-item binary 在 MATH 上几乎无信号。D-study 需要 ~950 items 达到 G≥0.90，是 MMLU 的 1.5×。\n866\t\n867\t    '\n868\t  tables:\n869\t  - name: 'Table S4: MATH vs GSM8K vs MMLU (single-model avg, binary, %)'\n870\t    rows:\n871\t    - source: item_id\n872\t      MMLU: 52.9\n873\t      GSM8K: 34.5\n874\t      MATH: 28.0\n875\t    - source: seed×item\n876\t      MMLU: 3.1\n877\t      GSM8K: 11.5\n878\t      MATH: 12.8\n879\t    - source: temp×item\n880\t      MMLU: 6.4\n881\t      GSM8K: 10.8\n882\t      MATH: 11.5\n883\t    - source: residual\n884\t      MMLU: 17.1\n885\t      GSM8K: 23.8\n886\t      MATH: 26.5\n887\t    - source: G_binary_200\n888\t      MMLU: 0.33\n889\t      GSM8K: 0.22\n890\t      MATH: 0.18\n891\t  - name: 'Table S5: Extended D-study across 5 benchmarks (items for G≥0.90, binary)'\n892\t    rows:\n893\t    - benchmark: HellaSwag\n894\t      items: 480\n895\t    - benchmark: ARC\n896\t      items: 540\n897\t    - benchmark: MMLU\n898\t      items: 620\n899\t    - benchmark: GSM8K\n900\t      items: 780\n901\t    - benchmark: MATH\n902\t      items: 950\n903\t  figures_description:\n904\t  - 'Fig S5: Extended 5-benchmark stacked-bar (with MATH)。MATH 作为最极端推理任务，item_id 最低、seed/temp\n905\t    interaction 最高。'\n906\t  - 'Fig S6: D-study projection curves extended to 5 benchmarks。MATH 曲线最右——需要最多 items。'\n907\t  analysis: MATH 延续并强化了 GSM8K 的模式。5-benchmark 梯度 (HellaSwag 51% ≈ MMLU 53% > ARC 44%\n908\t    > GSM8K 35% > MATH 28%, 单模型; HellaSwag 33% ≈ MMLU 35% > ARC 27% > GSM8K 20% >\n909\t    MATH 16%, model-as-facet) 在方向上一致但 HellaSwag≈MMLU 仍然非单调。 MATH 的加入使 gradient 叙事更有说服力——从\n910\t    knowledge retrieval 到 multi-step reasoning 的 item_id 递减跨越 ~20pp (model-as-facet)。D-study\n911\t    范围扩展到 480-950 items (G≥0.90)，differentiation 比只有 4 benchmarks 时更明显。 此实验适合 Supplementary\n912\t    或 extended analysis，强化 Claim 1 和 Claim 3。\n913\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2d63766f-bc10-4c20-ac66-9e0508e2e2bf","uuid":"489e9517-2ba6-4aad-b4f6-82be71efead0","timestamp":"2026-05-21T04:30:12.159Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0519/projects/nlp_variance_gtheory/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260521T032813/median/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: 'Item dominance weakens under model-as-facet reanalysis (单模型~54%\n  → 多模型35%) 但仍是最大单一 方差源；与 model×item 的差距仅 ~13pp，在 GSM8K 上 CI 重叠甚至反转。跨 benchmark 梯度方向性\n  存在（MMLU 35% → GSM8K 20%）但非单调——HellaSwag ≈ MMLU 打破预期 knowledge→reasoning 排序。 可分离性在知识型任务上成立（<1%\n  binary）但 text_match 下已显现裂痕（2.8%）；推理型 benchmark 因设计限制（仅 bf16/fp16）未被直接测试，需标注为 projected\n  failure。D-study 预算跨 benchmark 有差异（480-780 items for G≥0.90）但不如预期戏剧性。Gemma 排除（3 模型）。Claim\n  1 弱化为 「item 和 model×item 联合主导」；Claim 2 限定为「benchmark-conditional separability —\n  知识 任务上成立，推理任务上预计失败」；Claim 3 加重 benchmark-specificity 措辞。AAAI 可行但紧； ACL ARR 是现实备选。\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: Full-scale MMLU precision study\n  plan_id: exp-001\n  description: '4 models attempted, Gemma-2-9B-IT fp16 触发 vLLM 数值保护，仅完成 bf16+fp32。\n    最终 3 模型 (Qwen3-8B, Llama-3.1-8B, Mistral-7B) 完成全部 3 prec × 6 prompts × 6 seeds\n    × 3 temps × 4 orderings × 200 items = 1296 conditions/model。 V0 enforce_eager\n    修复了 engine confound。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    total_records_3model: 777600\n    gemma_partial_records: 172800\n    total_records: 950400\n    conditions_per_model: 1296\n    accuracy_llama_bf16: 0.711\n    accuracy_llama_fp16: 0.711\n    accuracy_llama_fp32: 0.604\n    accuracy_qwen_bf16: 0.698\n    accuracy_qwen_fp16: 0.695\n    accuracy_qwen_fp32: 0.621\n    accuracy_mistral_bf16: 0.637\n    accuracy_mistral_fp16: 0.635\n    accuracy_mistral_fp32: 0.584\n    item_id_pct_llama: 57.8\n    item_id_pct_qwen: 52.6\n    item_id_pct_mistral: 48.2\n    item_id_pct_avg: 52.9\n    residual_pct_avg: 17.1\n    precision_x_item_pct_avg: 7.0\n    temperature_x_item_pct_avg: 6.4\n    prompt_x_item_pct_avg: 5.6\n    seed_x_item_pct_avg: 3.1\n    ordering_x_item_pct_avg: 2.0\n    precision_pct_avg: 2.1\n    temperature_pct_avg: 1.5\n    prompt_pct_avg: 0.9\n    precision_x_temperature_binary_avg: 0.3\n    g_coeff_binary_200item_avg: 0.33\n    g_coeff_text_match_200item_avg: 0.94\n    g_coeff_binary_range: '[0.30, 0.36]'\n    fp32_bf16_gap_pp_avg: 8.2\n    null_predictions_total: 125\n    gpu_hours_used: 88\n  result_rationale: 'item_id 均值 52.9% 比 MVP (58.4%) 略低，因为 MVP 是单模型 (Llama) 的 108 条件设计，\n    扩展到 3 模型和 1296 条件后估计更稳定。模型间 item_id 从 48.2% (Mistral) 到 57.8% (Llama) 变异 ~10pp：Mistral\n    整体准确率低 (0.635)，更多 items 接近猜测基线 (p≈0.25)， Bernoulli p(1-p) 变异小于高准确率模型，机械性压缩了 item_id。但在单模型分析中无法分离\n    model×item——这部分方差归入 item_id 和 residual，预示 exp-004 model-as-facet 会大幅 重塑方差结构。precision×temperature\n    交互 0.3% (binary) 与 MVP 一致：fp32 degradation 是精度主效应而非与 temperature 的交互效应。G=0.33\n    (binary) 验证了 200 items 不足以 支撑可靠 model ranking 的核心叙事。text_match G=0.94 的巨大反差锚定了\n    Claim 3。 Gemma fp16 失败是已知架构限制——median 档下没有修复路径，排除后 3 模型设计仍平衡。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 1: Per-model accuracy (precision × temperature, 6-prompt 6-seed 4-ordering\n      avg)'\n    rows:\n    - model: Llama\n      bf16_T0.0: 0.73\n      bf16_T0.3: 0.709\n      bf16_T0.7: 0.694\n      fp16_T0.0: 0.731\n      fp16_T0.3: 0.708\n      fp16_T0.7: 0.695\n      fp32_T0.0: 0.622\n      fp32_T0.3: 0.602\n      fp32_T0.7: 0.588\n    - model: Qwen\n      bf16_T0.0: 0.718\n      bf16_T0.3: 0.696\n      bf16_T0.7: 0.681\n      fp16_T0.0: 0.716\n      fp16_T0.3: 0.693\n      fp16_T0.7: 0.677\n      fp32_T0.0: 0.641\n      fp32_T0.3: 0.619\n      fp32_T0.7: 0.604\n    - model: Mistral\n      bf16_T0.0: 0.658\n      bf16_T0.3: 0.636\n      bf16_T0.7: 0.618\n      fp16_T0.0: 0.656\n      fp16_T0.3: 0.633\n      fp16_T0.7: 0.615\n      fp32_T0.0: 0.603\n      fp32_T0.3: 0.582\n      fp32_T0.7: 0.567\n  - name: 'Table 2: Single-model G-study variance decomposition (binary, %)'\n    rows:\n    - source: item_id\n      Llama: 57.8\n      Qwen: 52.6\n      Mistral: 48.2\n      avg: 52.9\n    - source: residual\n      Llama: 15.2\n      Qwen: 17.4\n      Mistral: 18.6\n      avg: 17.1\n    - source: prec×item\n      Llama: 7.5\n      Qwen: 7.2\n      Mistral: 6.4\n      avg: 7.0\n    - source: temp×item\n      Llama: 5.8\n      Qwen: 6.5\n      Mistral: 6.8\n      avg: 6.4\n    - source: prompt×item\n      Llama: 4.8\n      Qwen: 5.8\n      Mistral: 6.2\n      avg: 5.6\n    - source: seed×item\n      Llama: 2.8\n      Qwen: 3.1\n      Mistral: 3.4\n      avg: 3.1\n    - source: order×item\n      Llama: 1.8\n      Qwen: 2.0\n      Mistral: 2.3\n      avg: 2.0\n    - source: precision\n      Llama: 1.6\n      Qwen: 2.0\n      Mistral: 2.8\n      avg: 2.1\n    - source: temperature\n      Llama: 1.2\n      Qwen: 1.4\n      Mistral: 1.8\n      avg: 1.5\n    - source: prec×temp\n      Llama: 0.2\n      Qwen: 0.3\n      Mistral: 0.5\n      avg: 0.3\n    - source: other\n      Llama: 1.3\n      Qwen: 1.7\n      Mistral: 3.0\n      avg: 2.0\n  figures_description:\n  - Stacked-bar 方差分解对比 3 个模型 (binary)。item_id 始终最大但 Mistral 明显低于 Llama (48% vs 58%)，预示\n    model-as-facet 的必要性。\n  - Precision × temperature 交互热力图 (binary, per model)。fp32 在所有 temp 下系统偏低，交互项 <0.5%。\n  analysis: 'exp-001 确认了 item dominance 的基本事实但暴露了模型依赖性。Mistral 的 item_id 低 (48%) 源于其\n    MMLU 表现较弱导致的 Bernoulli 效应，这将在 exp-004 的 MD1 分析中被量化。 fp32 degradation 在 V0 enforce_eager\n    下持续 (~8pp)，证实是真实精度效应。G=0.33 为 D-study narrative 提供了锚点。3 模型设计允许 model-as-facet\n    但自由度有限。\n\n    '\n- name: Item resampling stability test\n  plan_id: exp-001b\n  description: '3 independent stratified 200-item MMLU samples (seeds 0, 7, 99) ×\n    Llama × 3 prec × 3 prompts × 3 seeds × 2 orderings = 54 conditions/sample × 200\n    items。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    total_records_per_sample: 10800\n    total_records: 32400\n    item_id_pct_sample0: 55.2\n    item_id_pct_sample7: 50.8\n    item_id_pct_sample99: 58.6\n    item_id_mean: 54.9\n    item_id_sd: 3.9\n    item_id_cv: 0.071\n    g_coeff_binary_sample0: 0.34\n    g_coeff_binary_sample7: 0.3\n    g_coeff_binary_sample99: 0.36\n    g_coeff_mean: 0.333\n    g_coeff_sd: 0.03\n    accuracy_range: '[0.669, 0.691]'\n    residual_pct_range: '[14.2, 18.6]'\n    item_id_always_largest: true\n    gpu_hours_used: 12\n  result_rationale: 'item_id 从 50.8% 到 58.6% (SD=3.9pp) 反映了 stratified sampling 未完全消除的\n    item 难度分布变异。sample7 (50.8%) 恰好抽到了更均匀的 item 难度分布——容易题和 难题的比例更平衡——导致 Bernoulli p(1-p)\n    变异较小，item_id 机械性降低。这个 ~8pp 极差在 median 档下是 「noisy but directionally consistent」——item_id\n    始终最大， 但精确百分比对 item draw 敏感。G-coefficient 的 0.30-0.36 范围传递了一致信号： 200 items (binary)\n    总是不够。CV=7.1% 说明 headline number 必须报告为区间。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 3: Resampling stability across 3 item draws'\n    rows:\n    - metric: item_id_pct\n      s0: 55.2\n      s7: 50.8\n      s99: 58.6\n      mean: 54.9\n      sd: 3.9\n    - metric: residual_pct\n      s0: 15.8\n      s7: 18.6\n      s99: 14.2\n      mean: 16.2\n      sd: 2.3\n    - metric: g_binary\n      s0: 0.34\n      s7: 0.3\n      s99: 0.36\n      mean: 0.333\n      sd: 0.03\n    - metric: g_text_match\n      s0: 0.93\n      s7: 0.91\n      s99: 0.95\n      mean: 0.93\n      sd: 0.02\n    - metric: accuracy\n      s0: 0.678\n      s7: 0.691\n      s99: 0.669\n      mean: 0.679\n      sd: 0.011\n  figures_description:\n  - 3-sample item_id 分布图 with 95% CI。方向一致但 CI 宽。\n  analysis: 'item 抽样引入 ~4pp SD 的不确定性，强化了 bootstrap CI (exp-004) 的方法论必要性。 关键收获：G-coefficient\n    结论 (binary < 0.40) 跨样本稳健；headline item_id 需要 报告为 ~55% [51, 59] 而非点估计。\n\n    '\n- name: Multi-benchmark replication\n  plan_id: exp-002\n  description: '3 models (Gemma excluded) × 2 prec (bf16/fp16) × 6 prompts × 6 seeds\n    × 2 temps (T=0.0, T=0.7) × 4 orderings × 200 items, on GSM8K, ARC-Challenge, HellaSwag.\n    Reduced design (2 prec × 2 temp vs exp-001 的 3×3)。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    conditions_per_model_per_bench: 576\n    total_records_per_bench: 345600\n    total_records: 1036800\n    accuracy_gsm8k: 0.412\n    accuracy_arc: 0.588\n    accuracy_hellaswag: 0.762\n    item_id_pct_gsm8k: 34.5\n    item_id_pct_arc: 43.8\n    item_id_pct_hellaswag: 51.2\n    seed_x_item_gsm8k: 11.5\n    temp_x_item_gsm8k: 10.8\n    prompt_x_item_gsm8k: 9.2\n    seed_x_item_arc: 5.8\n    temp_x_item_arc: 7.2\n    prompt_x_item_arc: 7.5\n    seed_x_item_hellaswag: 3.4\n    temp_x_item_hellaswag: 5.5\n    prompt_x_item_hellaswag: 5.2\n    precision_x_temp_gsm8k_binary: 0.2\n    precision_x_temp_arc_binary: 0.15\n    precision_x_temp_hellaswag_binary: 0.1\n    precision_x_item_gsm8k: 1.2\n    precision_x_item_arc: 1.8\n    precision_x_item_hellaswag: 2.5\n    residual_gsm8k: 23.8\n    residual_arc: 18.5\n    residual_hellaswag: 15.8\n    g_coeff_binary_gsm8k: 0.22\n    g_coeff_binary_arc: 0.28\n    g_coeff_binary_hellaswag: 0.35\n    g_coeff_text_match_gsm8k: 0.78\n    g_coeff_text_match_arc: 0.88\n    g_coeff_text_match_hellaswag: 0.95\n    gpu_hours_used: 178\n  result_rationale: 'GSM8K item_id (34.5%, 单模型) 大幅低于 MMLU (52.9%)，因为数学推理中 seed 和 temperature\n    通过改变 chain-of-thought 路径产生强 item-conditional 效应。同一数学题 在不同 seed 下走不同推理链——有的走通有的走不通——seed×item\n    (11.5%) 和 temp×item (10.8%) 合计 >22%，远超 MMLU 的 ~9.5%。ARC (43.8%) 居中因为科学推理也有 prompt/\n    seed sensitivity 但弱于数学。HellaSwag (51.2%) 接近 MMLU (52.9%) 是 median 档的 关键特征——commonsense\n    补全任务的方差结构更接近 knowledge retrieval 而非 multi-step reasoning，因为 HellaSwag 主要考验的是 pattern\n    completion 而非推理链。这打破了预期 的单调 knowledge→reasoning 梯度。precision 交互在 bf16/fp16-only\n    设计下全部 <0.3% (binary)——这不构成对 separability 的有力测试，因为 bf16≈fp16 是已知的。真正的 separability\n    测试需要 fp32 或 hardware crossing，只在 exp-001/003 (MMLU) 中完成。 G-coefficient 梯度 (0.22→0.35\n    binary) 说明 200-item binary 可靠性系统性随任务类型 变化，但 text_match 下 HellaSwag 已达 0.95，强化\n    metric-conditional 叙事。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 4: Cross-benchmark single-model variance decomposition (binary, 3-model\n      avg, %)'\n    rows:\n    - source: item_id\n      GSM8K: 34.5\n      ARC: 43.8\n      HellaSwag: 51.2\n      MMLU (exp-001): 52.9\n    - source: residual\n      GSM8K: 23.8\n      ARC: 18.5\n      HellaSwag: 15.8\n      MMLU (exp-001): 17.1\n    - source: seed×item\n      GSM8K: 11.5\n      ARC: 5.8\n      HellaSwag: 3.4\n      MMLU (exp-001): 3.1\n    - source: temp×item\n      GSM8K: 10.8\n      ARC: 7.2\n      HellaSwag: 5.5\n      MMLU (exp-001): 6.4\n    - source: prompt×item\n      GSM8K: 9.2\n      ARC: 7.5\n      HellaSwag: 5.2\n      MMLU (exp-001): 5.6\n    - source: prec×item\n      GSM8K: 1.2\n      ARC: 1.8\n      HellaSwag: 2.5\n      MMLU (exp-001): 7.0\n    - source: prec×temp\n      GSM8K: 0.2\n      ARC: 0.15\n      HellaSwag: 0.1\n      MMLU (exp-001): 0.3\n    - source: other\n      GSM8K: 8.8\n      ARC: 15.25\n      HellaSwag: 16.3\n      MMLU (exp-001): 7.6\n  - name: 'Table 5: Per-benchmark accuracy by model (bf16, all-condition avg)'\n    rows:\n    - benchmark: GSM8K\n      Llama: 0.486\n      Qwen: 0.452\n      Mistral: 0.298\n    - benchmark: ARC\n      Llama: 0.641\n      Qwen: 0.618\n      Mistral: 0.505\n    - benchmark: HellaSwag\n      Llama: 0.798\n      Qwen: 0.782\n      Mistral: 0.707\n  - name: 'Table 6: G-coefficients by benchmark × metric (200 items)'\n    rows:\n    - benchmark: GSM8K\n      g_binary: 0.22\n      g_text_match: 0.78\n    - benchmark: ARC\n      g_binary: 0.28\n      g_text_match: 0.88\n    - benchmark: HellaSwag\n      g_binary: 0.35\n      g_text_match: 0.95\n    - benchmark: MMLU (exp-001)\n      g_binary: 0.33\n      g_text_match: 0.94\n  figures_description:\n  - Stacked-bar 方差分解 across 4 benchmarks (MMLU from exp-001 + 3 new)。论文 signature\n    figure 草稿——item_id 递减但 HellaSwag ≈ MMLU。注意 MMLU 的 prec×item 偏高因为 3 prec vs 其余\n    2 prec，设计不对称标注在图注中。\n  - G-coefficient by benchmark × metric (binary vs text_match)。分组柱状图显示 binary 和 text_match\n    的鲜明反差。\n  analysis: 'cross-benchmark gradient 的方向性成立但非单调：HellaSwag (51.2%) 与 MMLU (52.9%)\n    仅差 1.7pp (统计上不可区分)，ARC (43.8%) 居中，GSM8K (34.5%) 明显更低。梯度范围 18.4pp (52.9→34.5)。但这是单模型数据——model-as-facet\n    (exp-004) 会进一步压缩 item_id 并可能 改变排序。exp-002 的 bf16/fp16-only 设计意味着 precision 相关方差分量不可与\n    exp-001 (3 prec) 直接比较；MD8 sensitivity analysis 需要 re-analyze MMLU with matched\n    2×2。\n\n    '\n- name: Multi-hardware G-study\n  plan_id: exp-003\n  description: '3 models × 2 GPU types (RTX PRO 6000 + second GPU) × 2 prec (bf16/fp16)\n    × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 3 temps × 4 orderings × 200 MMLU items。 Second GPU 可用性有限——仅\n    2 models 在 second GPU 上完成全部设计。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    total_records_primary_gpu: 518400\n    total_records_second_gpu: 230400\n    total_records: 748800\n    models_on_both_gpus: 2\n    second_gpu_availability_days: 8\n    hardware_main_effect_pp: 0.14\n    hardware_pct_variance: 0.08\n    hardware_x_item_pct: 1.8\n    hardware_x_precision_pct: 0.12\n    hardware_x_temperature_pct: 0.06\n    hardware_x_prompt_pct: 0.03\n    hardware_x_seed_pct: 0.02\n    direct_infra_x_method_binary: 0.5\n    direct_infra_x_method_text_match: 2.8\n    item_id_pct_with_hw: 53.2\n    precision_pct: 0.15\n    hardware_pct: 0.08\n    residual_pct: 15.8\n    max_item_accuracy_gap_across_gpus_pp: 3.2\n    items_with_flipped_majority_vote: 4\n    gpu_hours_used: 95\n  result_rationale: 'hardware 主效应极小 (0.14pp) 因为相同 vLLM 代码路径在不同 GPU 上产生几乎相同的结果； 差异来自\n    CUDA kernel 层面的浮点非确定性和 GPU 架构特定的 tensor core 实现差异。 hardware×item (1.8%) 比 hardware\n    主效应大一个数量级，因为 logit margin 极小的 items (模型在 0/1 边界附近的题) 对硬件级数值噪声敏感。但 1.8% 仍远小于 precision×item\n    (MMLU exp-001 ~7%)，说明 GPU 型号的影响远弱于精度选择。direct infra×method 在 binary 下 0.5% (边缘通过\n    <1% 阈值)，text_match 下 2.8%——后者由 precision×temperature (1.5%) + hardware×temperature\n    (0.8%) + hardware×precision (0.5%) 累积而成。median 档的 关键限制是 second GPU 仅支持 2 模型，估计精度有限，结论需标注为\n    preliminary。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 7: Hardware effect summary (2-model balanced MMLU)'\n    rows:\n    - metric: aggregate accuracy gap (pp)\n      value: 0.14\n    - metric: max item-level gap (pp)\n      value: 3.2\n    - metric: hardware % total variance\n      value: 0.08\n    - metric: hardware×item % variance\n      value: 1.8\n    - metric: direct infra×method binary (%)\n      value: 0.5\n    - metric: direct infra×method text_match (%)\n      value: 2.8\n    - metric: items with flipped majority vote\n      value: 4\n  figures_description:\n  - GPU A vs GPU B item-level accuracy scatter (200 items × 2 models)。绝大多数 items 在对角线上；4\n    个偏离点标注——均为 low-margin items。\n  analysis: 'multi-hardware 支持 aggregate separability but with caveats。binary 0.5%\n    勉强通过 <1% 阈值；text_match 2.8% 明确超过实际意义阈值。论文应将此定位为 「preliminary evidence supporting\n    separability on MMLU under binary scoring, with metric-conditional violation under\n    text_match」。2-model 限制意味着 bootstrap CI 很宽——hardware facet 的估计是所有方差分量中精度最低的。\n\n    '\n- name: Comprehensive analysis\n  plan_id: exp-004\n  description: 'Combined analysis of exp-001/001b/002/003。核心产出：model-as-facet reanalysis,\n    bootstrap CIs, D-study projections, G-theory vs IRT, all MD defense analyses。\n    纯分析实验 (0 GPU hours)。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    maf_item_id_mmlu: 35.0\n    maf_model_x_item_mmlu: 21.5\n    maf_model_mmlu: 8.2\n    maf_residual_mmlu: 12.8\n    maf_prec_x_item_mmlu: 5.2\n    maf_temp_x_item_mmlu: 4.6\n    maf_prompt_x_item_mmlu: 4.0\n    maf_seed_x_item_mmlu: 2.5\n    maf_order_x_item_mmlu: 1.5\n    maf_model_x_prec_mmlu: 0.5\n    maf_model_x_temp_mmlu: 0.3\n    maf_other_mmlu: 3.9\n    maf_item_id_hellaswag: 33.0\n    maf_item_id_arc: 27.0\n    maf_item_id_gsm8k: 20.0\n    maf_model_x_item_hellaswag: 16.0\n    maf_model_x_item_arc: 18.5\n    maf_model_x_item_gsm8k: 26.0\n    maf_model_gsm8k: 14.0\n    maf_model_arc: 12.0\n    maf_model_hellaswag: 9.5\n    ci_item_id_mmlu: '[28.5, 41.5]'\n    ci_model_x_item_mmlu: '[15.0, 28.0]'\n    ci_item_id_gsm8k: '[13.5, 26.5]'\n    ci_model_x_item_gsm8k: '[19.5, 32.5]'\n    ci_width_item_id_mmlu: 13.0\n    ci_width_item_id_gsm8k: 13.0\n    ci_overlap_mmlu: false\n    ci_overlap_hellaswag: false\n    ci_overlap_arc: false\n    ci_overlap_gsm8k: true\n    dstudy_g90_mmlu: 620\n    dstudy_g90_hellaswag: 480\n    dstudy_g90_arc: 540\n    dstudy_g90_gsm8k: 780\n    dstudy_g95_mmlu: 1100\n    dstudy_g_at_200_mmlu_binary: 0.3\n    dstudy_g_at_200_mmlu_text_match: 0.93\n    dstudy_g_at_14k_mmlu_binary: 0.985\n    reml_henderson_max_diff_pp: 2.8\n    reml_henderson_rank_preserved: true\n    logprob_item_id_mmlu: 48.0\n    logprob_item_id_gsm8k: 25.0\n    gtheory_items_mmlu: 620\n    irt_tinyBench_items: 100\n    gtheory_irt_ratio: 6.2\n    power_detect_2pct: 0.88\n    power_detect_1pct: 0.62\n    fixed_random_max_diff_pp: 3.5\n    fixed_random_rank_preserved: true\n    bernoulli_corr_with_item_id: 0.72\n    bootstrap_jackknife_ci_ratio: 1.15\n    mmlu_3x3_vs_2x2_item_id_diff: 2.1\n    g_at_14k_binary: 0.985\n    gpu_hours_for_g90_mmlu: 45\n    gpu_hours_for_g90_gsm8k: 85\n  result_rationale: 'model-as-facet 将 MMLU item_id 从 52.9% 压到 35%：差额中 ~17.9pp 被重新归因为\n    model×item (21.5%) 和 model (8.2%)。在单模型分析中，不同模型对不同 items 的差异化 表现 (differential\n    item functioning) 被隐藏在 item_id 和 residual 中；3 模型设计 使其可分离。35% 仍是最大方差源，但与 model×item\n    (21.5%) 的差距仅 13.5pp。在 GSM8K 上 model×item (26%) 反超 item_id (20%)——因为 3 模型在数学题上的能力差异极大\n    (Qwen 45% vs Mistral 30%)，且不同模型擅长不同类型的数学题，创造了巨大的 model×item 交互。GSM8K 的 CI 重叠 ([13.5,\n    26.5] vs [19.5, 32.5]) 是 median 档的标志—— 无法在统计上区分 item_id 和 model×item 谁更大。 D-study\n    620 items (MMLU binary G≥0.90) vs IRT 100 items 的 6.2× 差距反映了本质区别： IRT 只关注 item\n    sampling 对排名一致性的影响，G-theory 同时控制 prompt/seed/ordering 的变异性。620 items 是对「用 1 prompt\n    + 1 seed + 200 items 评估」这种 common practice 的方法论批判——但 480-780 的跨 benchmark 范围说明\n    differentiation 没有预期的戏剧性。 Bernoulli 相关 r=0.72 说明 item_id 中约一半是 p(1-p) 机械效应，但这不削弱\n    practical implication——item 选择确实改变评估结果。bootstrap vs jackknife CI 比值 1.15 说明 bootstrap\n    略微高估不确定性（因为重采样破坏 item 独立性），但差异可接受。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 8: Model-as-facet variance decomposition across benchmarks (binary,\n      %)'\n    rows:\n    - source: item_id\n      MMLU: 35.0\n      HellaSwag: 33.0\n      ARC: 27.0\n      GSM8K: 20.0\n    - source: model×item\n      MMLU: 21.5\n      HellaSwag: 16.0\n      ARC: 18.5\n      GSM8K: 26.0\n    - source: model\n      MMLU: 8.2\n      HellaSwag: 9.5\n      ARC: 12.0\n      GSM8K: 14.0\n    - source: residual\n      MMLU: 12.8\n      HellaSwag: 14.0\n      ARC: 16.0\n      GSM8K: 13.5\n    - source: temp×item\n      MMLU: 4.6\n      HellaSwag: 5.2\n      ARC: 6.0\n      GSM8K: 7.8\n    - source: prompt×item\n      MMLU: 4.0\n      HellaSwag: 4.5\n      ARC: 5.8\n      GSM8K: 6.5\n    - source: prec×item\n      MMLU: 5.2\n      HellaSwag: 3.5\n      ARC: 1.5\n      GSM8K: 1.0\n    - source: seed×item\n      MMLU: 2.5\n      HellaSwag: 2.8\n      ARC: 4.0\n      GSM8K: 5.5\n    - source: other\n      MMLU: 6.2\n      HellaSwag: 11.5\n      ARC: 9.2\n      GSM8K: 5.7\n  - name: 'Table 9: Bootstrap 95% CIs on item_id and model×item (pp)'\n    rows:\n    - benchmark: MMLU\n      item_id: 35.0 [28.5–41.5]\n      model_x_item: 21.5 [15.0–28.0]\n      overlap: 'No'\n    - benchmark: HellaSwag\n      item_id: 33.0 [26.0–40.0]\n      model_x_item: 16.0 [10.5–21.5]\n      overlap: 'No'\n    - benchmark: ARC\n      item_id: 27.0 [20.5–33.5]\n      model_x_item: 18.5 [12.0–25.0]\n      overlap: 'No'\n    - benchmark: GSM8K\n      item_id: 20.0 [13.5–26.5]\n      model_x_item: 26.0 [19.5–32.5]\n      overlap: 'Yes'\n  - name: 'Table 10: D-study — items for target G (binary, 6 prompts × 6 seeds averaged)'\n    rows:\n    - benchmark: MMLU\n      G_0.80: 280\n      G_0.90: 620\n      G_0.95: 1100\n      G_0.99: 4200\n    - benchmark: HellaSwag\n      G_0.80: 240\n      G_0.90: 480\n      G_0.95: 850\n      G_0.99: 3200\n    - benchmark: ARC\n      G_0.80: 260\n      G_0.90: 540\n      G_0.95: 960\n      G_0.99: 3600\n    - benchmark: GSM8K\n      G_0.80: 380\n      G_0.90: 780\n      G_0.95: 1400\n      G_0.99: 5200\n  - name: 'Table 11: G-theory vs IRT subsampling (MMLU)'\n    rows:\n    - framework: G-theory D-study\n      items: 620\n      facets: item+prompt+seed+temp+order+prec\n      target: G≥0.90\n    - framework: tinyBenchmarks IRT\n      items: 100\n      facets: item only\n      target: r≥0.95 with full\n    - framework: ratio\n      items: 6.2×\n      facets: —\n      target: different definitions\n  - name: 'Table 12: Methodological defense results summary'\n    rows:\n    - defense: MD1 Bernoulli\n      result: r=0.72 with p(1-p); ~50% mechanical\n      verdict: acknowledged, text_match parallel validates\n    - defense: MD2 Fixed vs random\n      result: max diff 3.5pp, rank preserved\n      verdict: robust\n    - defense: MD5 Full benchmark G\n      result: G=0.985 at 14K items (binary)\n      verdict: 200-item G correctly interpreted as subsample cost\n    - defense: MD6 Bootstrap vs jackknife\n      result: CI ratio 1.15\n      verdict: bootstrap slightly wider, acceptable\n    - defense: MD8 Design asymmetry\n      result: 3×3 vs 2×2 diff 2.1pp item_id\n      verdict: robust to design reduction\n    - defense: MD9 Logprob scoring\n      result: item_id 48% (MMLU) / 25% (GSM8K)\n      verdict: gradient preserved across metrics\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 3 (论文 signature figure): Model-as-facet stacked-bar across 4 benchmarks (binary)。item_id\n    蓝色递减 35→20%, model×item 橙色在 GSM8K 反超。'\n  - 'Fig 4: D-study projection curves — G vs item count for 4 benchmarks, binary。GSM8K\n    曲线最右 (最多 items needed)。IRT tinyBenchmarks 100-item 参考线。'\n  - 'Fig 5: Bootstrap CI forest plot, item_id vs model×item, 4 benchmarks。GSM8K CI\n    重叠可视化。'\n  - 'Fig 6: Bernoulli p(1-p) vs observed item variance scatter (MMLU), r=0.72。'\n  analysis: 'exp-004 重新定义了叙事。Claim 1 从「item is THE dominant source」变为「item and model×item\n    jointly dominate — their relative importance is benchmark-conditional」。 GSM8K\n    上的 CI 重叠和 model×item 反超是 median 档最大的叙事压力点——需要诚实报告但 框定为「finding: even the variance\n    structure itself varies across task types」。 D-study 的 benchmark-specificity (480-780\n    items) 支持 Claim 3 但 differentiation 不戏剧性——4 benchmarks 都在 ~500-800 range，不是 100\n    vs 2000 那样的鲜明对比。 G-theory vs IRT 的 6.2× gap 是可以独立展开的贡献——「the cost of multi-facet\n    reliability」。power=0.88 for 2% interaction 意味着如果真实 infra×method 在 2% 以上我们大概率能检测到，但\n    <1% 的效应 (power=0.62) 可能被遗漏——论文需承认这一限制。\n\n    '\n- name: 14B model extension\n  plan_id: exp-005\n  description: 'Qwen3-14B, DeepSeek-R1-Distill-14B × bf16/fp16 × 6 prompts × 6 seeds\n    × 2 temps × 4 orderings × 200 MMLU items。验证 scale robustness。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    total_records_per_model: 115200\n    total_records: 230400\n    accuracy_qwen14b_bf16: 0.752\n    accuracy_deepseek14b_bf16: 0.738\n    precision_gap_pp_avg: 0.35\n    item_id_pct_qwen14b: 50.5\n    item_id_pct_deepseek14b: 46.8\n    item_id_pct_avg: 48.7\n    prompt_x_item_deepseek14b: 8.2\n    g_coeff_binary_200_avg: 0.35\n    gpu_hours_used: 85\n  result_rationale: '14B 模型的 item_id (~49%) 略低于 8B (~53%)，因为更强的模型对更多 items 有高置信 正确答案\n    (ceiling effect)，压缩了 item 间 accuracy 变异。precision gap 从 ~8pp 降到 <0.4pp——14B 模型\n    logit margin 更大，bf16/fp16 truncation 几乎不翻转预测。 DeepSeek-R1-Distill 的 prompt×item\n    偏高 (8.2%) 可能源于 reasoning-distilled 架构对 prompt 格式的条件依赖更强。整体方差结构保持一致，支持跨 scale 泛化。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table S1: 8B vs 14B variance structure (MMLU, single-model, binary, %)'\n    rows:\n    - source: item_id\n      8B avg: 52.9\n      Qwen3_14B: 50.5\n      DeepSeek_14B: 46.8\n    - source: prec×item\n      8B avg: 7.0\n      Qwen3_14B: 3.2\n      DeepSeek_14B: 2.8\n    - source: prompt×item\n      8B avg: 5.6\n      Qwen3_14B: 5.0\n      DeepSeek_14B: 8.2\n    - source: precision\n      8B avg: 2.1\n      Qwen3_14B: 0.2\n      DeepSeek_14B: 0.15\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig S1: 8B vs 14B item_id comparison bar chart。Scale 增大 item_id 略降但 rank structure\n    不变。'\n  analysis: 'Scale robustness 得到确认。14B 的 precision sensitivity 大幅下降 (<0.4pp) 是一个 useful\n    practical finding——更大的模型对数值精度更稳健。适合 Appendix/Supplementary。\n\n    '\n- name: Fine-tuning G-study\n  plan_id: exp-006\n  description: 'RoBERTa-large fine-tuning × SST-2/MNLI/RTE/COPA。6 seeds × 3 LR × 4\n    data shuffles × 3 GPUs × 2 precisions = 432 runs/task × 4 tasks = 1728 total。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    total_runs: 1728\n    tasks_completed: 4\n    learning_rate_pct: 22.0\n    seed_pct: 18.5\n    data_shuffle_pct: 16.0\n    item_id_pct: 12.5\n    residual_pct: 14.0\n    lr_x_item_pct: 4.8\n    seed_x_item_pct: 5.5\n    data_shuffle_x_item_pct: 3.5\n    gpu_pct: 0.6\n    precision_pct: 0.4\n    gpu_x_precision_pct: 0.2\n    other_pct: 2.0\n    g_coeff_binary_avg: 0.45\n    accuracy_sst2: 0.942\n    accuracy_mnli: 0.876\n    accuracy_rte: 0.728\n    accuracy_copa: 0.685\n    item_id_rank: 4\n    top_source: learning_rate\n    gpu_hours_used: 165\n  result_rationale: 'fine-tuning 的方差层级与 inference 根本不同。learning_rate (22%) 主导因为 encoder\n    fine-tuning 在小 LR 范围内对最终性能极敏感 (Dodge et al. 2020)。seed (18.5%) 和 data_shuffle\n    (16%) 上升是因为 SGD 随机性在小数据集 (RTE 2.5K, COPA 400 samples) 上导致训练轨迹显著分歧——不同 seed 可能收敛到\n    loss landscape 的不同局部最优。 item_id 降到 12.5% 因为 fine-tuning 让模型适应了 task-specific item\n    难度分布， 压缩了 item 间差异。GPU 和 precision 合计 <1%——training 的随机性远超硬件噪声。 这个「方差层级翻转」(item_id\n    从 #1 降到 #4) 表明 inference 和 fine-tuning 需要 完全不同的 reproducibility budget。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table S2: Inference vs fine-tuning variance hierarchy (%)'\n    rows:\n    - source: item_id / item_id\n      inference_MMLU: 52.9\n      finetuning_avg: 12.5\n      shift: ↓41pp (#1→#4)\n    - source: precision / learning_rate\n      inference_MMLU: 2.1\n      finetuning_avg: 22.0\n      shift: ↑20pp (不同 facet)\n    - source: seed main / seed main\n      inference_MMLU: 0.2\n      finetuning_avg: 18.5\n      shift: ↑18pp\n    - source: prompt / data_shuffle\n      inference_MMLU: 0.9\n      finetuning_avg: 16.0\n      shift: ↑15pp (不同 facet)\n    - source: GPU / GPU\n      inference_MMLU: <0.1\n      finetuning_avg: 0.6\n      shift: ≈\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig S2: Paired stacked-bar: inference (MMLU) vs fine-tuning 方差层级。可视化 item_id\n    和 LR/seed 的位置互换。'\n  - 'Fig S3: Per-task fine-tuning 方差分解。RTE/COPA (小数据) 的 seed variance 远大于 SST-2/MNLI。'\n  analysis: 'fine-tuning 结果为论文贡献了 scope qualification：item dominance 是 inference evaluation\n    的特征，不是 ML evaluation 的普遍规律。GPU×precision 在 fine-tuning 中也可忽略 (0.2%)，说明 infra separability\n    跨 paradigm 成立。RTE/COPA 的高 seed variance 与 Dodge et al. (2020) 一致。此实验适合论文 Discussion\n    section 用于 界定 claims 的适用范围。\n\n    '\n- name: LayerCast precision study\n  plan_id: exp-007\n  description: 'LayerCast (fp16 storage + fp32 compute) as 4th precision condition\n    on MMLU。 Llama × 4 prec × 3 prompts × 3 seeds × 2 temps × 2 orderings × 200 items。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    total_records: 28800\n    conditions: 144\n    accuracy_layercast: 0.708\n    accuracy_bf16: 0.711\n    accuracy_fp16: 0.711\n    accuracy_fp32: 0.604\n    layercast_bf16_gap_pp: 0.3\n    layercast_fp32_gap_pp: 10.4\n    precision_variance_with_layercast: 1.4\n    precision_x_item_with_layercast: 4.8\n    precision_variance_without_layercast: 2.1\n    precision_x_item_without_layercast: 7.0\n    gpu_hours_used: 18\n  result_rationale: 'LayerCast (0.708) 接近 bf16 (0.711) 因为 fp32 compute path 保留了 attention\n    计算精度，fp16 storage 不影响前向传播。与 pure fp32 (0.604) 的 10.4pp 差距证实 fp32 degradation 不是数值精度本身的问题，而是\n    vLLM fp32 code path 的系统差异 (可能涉及不同的 attention kernel 或 memory layout)。从 G-theory\n    角度，加入 LayerCast 后 precision 方差分量从 2.1% 降到 1.4%——有改善但不戏剧性，因为 fp32 仍然是 outlier。precision×item\n    从 7.0% 降到 4.8% 说明 LayerCast 减少了 item-conditional 精度效应。这提供了 practical mitigation\n    recommendation 但 不改变论文核心叙事。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table S3: LayerCast vs standard precisions (Llama, MMLU)'\n    rows:\n    - precision: LayerCast\n      accuracy: 0.708\n      prec_pct: 0.3\n      prec_x_item_pct: 4.5\n    - precision: bf16\n      accuracy: 0.711\n      prec_pct: 0.1\n      prec_x_item_pct: 3.8\n    - precision: fp16\n      accuracy: 0.711\n      prec_pct: 0.1\n      prec_x_item_pct: 3.9\n    - precision: fp32\n      accuracy: 0.604\n      prec_pct: 2.1\n      prec_x_item_pct: 7.0\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig S4: 4-precision accuracy bar chart with LayerCast。LayerCast ≈ bf16 >> fp32。'\n  analysis: 'LayerCast 是 Appendix mitigation recommendation。核心贡献是排除 fp32 degradation\n    的「纯数值精度」解释——fp32 compute 在 LayerCast 中正常工作，问题出在 vLLM fp32 engine path。\n\n    '\n- name: MATH benchmark extension\n  plan_id: exp-008\n  description: 'MATH (200 items) × 3 models × 2 prec (bf16/fp16) × 6 prompts × 6 seeds\n    × 2 temps × 4 orderings。测试 chain-of-thought 推理的方差结构。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    total_records: 345600\n    accuracy_avg: 0.285\n    accuracy_llama: 0.312\n    accuracy_qwen: 0.335\n    accuracy_mistral: 0.208\n    item_id_pct: 28.0\n    residual_pct: 26.5\n    seed_x_item_pct: 12.8\n    temp_x_item_pct: 11.5\n    prompt_x_item_pct: 8.2\n    precision_x_item_pct: 1.5\n    seed_pct: 3.2\n    temperature_pct: 3.5\n    precision_x_temp_binary: 0.18\n    other_pct: 4.62\n    maf_item_id: 16.0\n    maf_model_x_item: 28.0\n    maf_model: 15.0\n    g_coeff_binary_200: 0.18\n    g_coeff_text_match_200: 0.62\n    dstudy_g90_binary: 950\n    gpu_hours_used: 42\n  result_rationale: 'MATH 的 item_id (28% 单模型, 16% model-as-facet) 是所有 benchmarks 中最低的，\n    因为多步数学推理中的 CoT 路径选择引入了巨大的 seed-conditional 和 temp-conditional item 变异。seed×item\n    (12.8%) + temp×item (11.5%) 合计 24.3%——一道题能否做对 取决于模型恰好走了哪条推理链，这是高度随机的。residual\n    高达 26.5% 反映了 CoT 的内在不可预测性——大量 item-level 方差无法归因于任何已测量 facet。model-as-facet 下 model×item\n    (28%) > item_id (16%)：3 模型的数学能力差异极大 (Qwen 34% vs Mistral 21%)，且不同模型擅长不同类型的数学题\n    (代数 vs 几何 vs 组合)，创造了 强 differential item functioning。precision×temperature 仅 0.18%\n    (binary) 因为 bf16/fp16-only 设计——这不构成 separability 的有力测试。G=0.18 是所有 benchmark 中最低的，说明\n    200-item binary 在 MATH 上几乎无信号。D-study 需要 ~950 items 达到 G≥0.90，是 MMLU 的 1.5×。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table S4: MATH vs GSM8K vs MMLU (single-model avg, binary, %)'\n    rows:\n    - source: item_id\n      MMLU: 52.9\n      GSM8K: 34.5\n      MATH: 28.0\n    - source: seed×item\n      MMLU: 3.1\n      GSM8K: 11.5\n      MATH: 12.8\n    - source: temp×item\n      MMLU: 6.4\n      GSM8K: 10.8\n      MATH: 11.5\n    - source: residual\n      MMLU: 17.1\n      GSM8K: 23.8\n      MATH: 26.5\n    - source: G_binary_200\n      MMLU: 0.33\n      GSM8K: 0.22\n      MATH: 0.18\n  - name: 'Table S5: Extended D-study across 5 benchmarks (items for G≥0.90, binary)'\n    rows:\n    - benchmark: HellaSwag\n      items: 480\n    - benchmark: ARC\n      items: 540\n    - benchmark: MMLU\n      items: 620\n    - benchmark: GSM8K\n      items: 780\n    - benchmark: MATH\n      items: 950\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig S5: Extended 5-benchmark stacked-bar (with MATH)。MATH 作为最极端推理任务，item_id 最低、seed/temp\n    interaction 最高。'\n  - 'Fig S6: D-study projection curves extended to 5 benchmarks。MATH 曲线最右——需要最多 items。'\n  analysis: MATH 延续并强化了 GSM8K 的模式。5-benchmark 梯度 (HellaSwag 51% ≈ MMLU 53% > ARC 44%\n    > GSM8K 35% > MATH 28%, 单模型; HellaSwag 33% ≈ MMLU 35% > ARC 27% > GSM8K 20% >\n    MATH 16%, model-as-facet) 在方向上一致但 HellaSwag≈MMLU 仍然非单调。 MATH 的加入使 gradient 叙事更有说服力——从\n    knowledge retrieval 到 multi-step reasoning 的 item_id 递减跨越 ~20pp (model-as-facet)。D-study\n    范围扩展到 480-950 items (G≥0.90)，differentiation 比只有 4 benchmarks 时更明显。 此实验适合 Supplementary\n    或 extended analysis，强化 Claim 1 和 Claim 3。\n","numLines":913,"startLine":1,"totalLines":913}}}
